						 <p>Right, hi! First solo written piece to the wiki!</p> <p>I'd like to thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sebarus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2341265&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602406582" alt="Sebarus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2341265)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sebarus" >Sebarus</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wendipeligo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6328573&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602406582" alt="Wendipeligo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6328573)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wendipeligo" >Wendipeligo</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brokenordinance" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2794964&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602406582" alt="BrokenOrdinance" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2794964)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brokenordinance" >BrokenOrdinance</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/avelon21" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5341612&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602406582" alt="Avelon21" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5341612)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/avelon21" >Avelon21</a></span> for the feedback, review, and support. I'd also like to extend my thanks to those active over at WL who let me use their characters/author avatars in this piece, as well as help building the new WL lore that this story is built upon!</p> <p>I hope this gives a glance of the kind of lore the Library itself has, rather than just being a hub for the Serpent's Hand.</p> <p>There's some easter eggs scattered throughout as well if you like reading for those things, but otherwise, enjoy!</p> <p>As for images, I made the majority and release them under CC. The one exception is Mirage's Library card, which utilizes a template <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187885&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602406582" alt="Rounderhouse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187885)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" >Rounderhouse</a></span> made, using assets from the WL site created by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/woedenaz" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404096&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1602406582" alt="Woedenaz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404096)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/woedenaz" >Woedenaz</a></span>. Also released under CC.</p> 
